		<sortname>023 =-  CHAMPION WRESTLER</sortname>
		<desc>Champion Wrestler gained popularity in the arcade, and now it is reborn on the PC Engine! Up to 2 people can play simultaneously as well, and you can also enjoy a large number of wrestlers and tag team. In order to take the TWF championship belt, the game will challenge you with formidable enemy skills.</desc>
