		<sortname>263 =-  POWER LEAGUE III</sortname>
		<desc>The fantastic Power League III is the full baseball experience wrapped into this amazing title. Become a true baseball superstar by selecting your team and then taking to the oval to bat, pitch and field your way to victory over the best teams in the world! Immerse yourself totally in the game and feel the every move of the player while smacking that ball out of the park!</desc>
